  "notes": [
    "Repairs first-person light shadows and the overlapping floor in the station safe room. The torch and lantern no longer project their own held-model shadows.",
    "Restores corroded service pipes, maintenance trolleys, drainage details and drifting station haze. Dimmer localized fixtures replace broad bright lighting, with restrained failing-ballast dips.",
    "Adds detailed dirty concrete, silt, muddy ground, leaf litter and irregular wet patches. Briarwake uses layered photo-detail, shaped leaves and rounded hedge backing with continuous corner joins.",
    "Replaces changing stamina text with a fixed running icon, percentage and bar. Resource rendering updates only when needed, and an exhaustion recovery threshold prevents rapid sprint toggling.",
    "Moves the farmer chainsaw off the pelvis into a canted two-handed carry and smooths its return after attacks.",
    "Windows 10/11 x64. Close the game, choose Check for updates, then Update & restart in the launcher. All players in your group should update."
  ],
